WEBVTT

00:09:28.549 --> 00:09:30.704
CA: In some ways, I never did.

00:09:30.728 --> 00:09:37.630
I was often the socially awkward
somewhat outsider

00:09:37.654 --> 00:09:41.123
who relied on a small number
of closer friends.

00:09:41.147 --> 00:09:47.823
I was never Mr. Popular,
and definitely not Mr. Cool. (Laughs)

00:09:47.847 --> 00:09:48.892
(Laughter)

00:09:48.916 --> 00:09:51.166
CA: But bringing it back to you, I mean,

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:56.174
as a shy, introverted kid, how on earth
did you end up being a corporate lawyer?

00:09:56.198 --> 00:09:57.833
SC: I went to law school,

00:09:57.857 --> 00:10:03.668
and the strangest thing was that
because I was such an unlikely lawyer,